176","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","content_id":"6edd9458-f4f8-4388-9fe0-c330422e47dd","details":{"body":"<p>The Minister for Housing and Planning is responsibile for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Planning reform and the National Planning Policy Framework</li>\n  <li>Housing delivery, including large-scale new settlements programme (New Towns)</li>\n  <li>Brownfield Infrastructure Land and Housing Infrastructure Funds</li>\n  <li>Housing supply strategy</li>\n  <li>Homes England and Planning Inspectorate sponsorship</li>\n  <li>HM Land Registry and land transparency</li>\n  <li>Social housing</li>\n  <li>Social and Affordable Homes Programme </li>\n  <li>Housing quality</li>\n  <li>Private rented sector</li>\n  <li>Leasehold and commonhold reform</li>\n  <li>Planning casework</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":25,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:47:20Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Housing and Planning)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/housing-local-and-community/local-plans","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/housing-local-and-community/local-plans","base_path":"/housing-local-and-community/local-plans","content_id":"bc2b7f1a-25b2-4115-8b8d-9b7822d11377","details":{"internal_name":"Local Plans [T] (level 3, housing theme)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","base_path":"/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","content_id":"e3147d4f-4bd5-4a14-a386-4ba7ccb058b4","detail